articles.content_en:
Article 1 For the purpose of profit, under any of the following circumstances, it shall be deemed as "assembling a crowd to engage in gambling" as stipulated in Article 303 of the Criminal Law:
(1) Organizing three or more persons to gamble, with the cumulative amount of the profits from the draw reaching 5,000 yuan or more;
(2) Organizing three or more persons to gamble, with the cumulative amount of gambling funds reaching 50,000 yuan or more;
(3) Organizing three or more persons to gamble, with the cumulative number of participants reaching 20 or more;
(4) Organizing ten or more citizens of the People's Republic of China to gamble abroad, and collecting kickbacks or referral fees therefrom.

Article 5 Where a gambling crime is committed and any of the following circumstances exists, a severe punishment shall be imposed in accordance with Article 303 of the Criminal Law:
(1) The perpetrator has the status of a state functionary;
(2) The perpetrator organizes state functionaries to gamble abroad;
(3) The perpetrator organizes minors to participate in gambling, or operates a gambling establishment to attract minors to participate in gambling.
